=1745766776\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What then?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can compete against the whole world in global leaderboards by finding the 100 Ghosts exceedingly quicker!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And after that?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can create your own levels or download user-created ones, including their own leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Level Editor DLC sold separately for 0.99$. I would like to keep the entire game free, but I sadly have to make back thhe 100$ Steam Fee and get funny stuff like tax advisers that keep me out of jail.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why would you do all that just to click Ghosts?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because it is just so much fun! Seriously. It is also cozy and relaxing. But most of all, every pop you hear from finding a Ghost releases a bit more dopamine.<br><br><br>Thank you for reading this and have a great day! :)</p>","developers":["Lemon Pohl","Leonie Droege"],"dlc":[3508610],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888450/header.jpg?t=1745766776","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2888450/879351/4107a204c8b2dfae82b6948f64d00b6cfa6ae38e/1750950985/dash_av1.mpd?t=1745766774","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2888450/879351/4107a204c8b2dfae82b6948f64d00b6cfa6ae38e/1750950985/dash_h264.mpd?t=1745766774","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2888450/879351/4107a204c8b2dfae82b6948f64d00b6cfa6ae38e/1750950985/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1745766774","id":257131754,"name":"Hidden Arcade - Free New Level!","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257131